sts/2026-09-27-rest/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 00:00:00 UTC</pubDate><description><p>从鼓楼到仙林，地铁通勤需要将近一个小时。</p><p>头几次去仙林之前，我会想，这两小时我该「干点啥」呢？</p></description></item><item><title>上海</title><link>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/</link><guid>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 UTC</pubDate><description><p>终于有时间回顾七月底的上海之行。</p><p>时隔十年的「故地重游」。</p><figure><img class="my-0 rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" alt="出发" width="1279" height="1706" src="/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/departure_hu_9e3fa026c7bf7db.jpg" srcset="/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/departure_hu_9e3fa026c7bf7db.jpg 800w, /posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/departure.jpg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw" data-zoom-src="/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/departure.jpg"><figcaption>出发</figcaption></figure><h2 class="relative group">第一晚<div id="第一晚" class="anchor"/><span class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"><a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e6%99%9a" aria-label="锚点">#</a></span></h2><p>酒店在五角场旁边。晚上七点，办好入住就没事了。想着来了上海好歹去线下体验体验，于是决定外出吃晚饭。</p></description></item><item><title>彼岸花</title><link>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-09-06-lycoris/</link><guid>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-09-06-lycoris/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 12:22:17 +0800</pubDate><description><figure><img class="my-0 rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" alt="彼岸花" width="4320" height="5760" src="/gallery/2026-09-06-lycoris/feature_IMG_20260906_122217_hu_f24f088de36ea006.jpg" srcset="/gallery/2026-09-06-lycoris/feature_IMG_20260906_122217_hu_f24f088de36ea006.jpg 800w, /gallery/2026-09-06-lycoris/feature_IMG_20260906_122217_hu_c3728b9c15d86d6d.jpg 1280w" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw" data-zoom-src="/gallery/2026-09-06-lycoris/feature_IMG_20260906_122217.jpg"/></description></item><item><title>孤独的 JVM</titl